.com/","section":"project","summary":"A comprehensive course in data wrangling, exploration, and analysis with R","tags":["website","R","bookdown"],"title":"stat545.com","type":"project"},{"authors":null,"categories":["website"],"content":"The tidymodels framework is a collection of R packages for modeling and machine learning using tidyverse principles. This website was built with Hugo, using a theme I developed and maintain. I worked with my former intern, Desirée De Leon, to design the style of the website.\n","date":1587427200,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1587427200,"objectID":"230c3e33261fe2029cd6f2e4d901c82d","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/project/tidymodels.org/","publishdate":"2020-04-21T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/~lynham/project/tidymodels.org/","section":"project","summary":"The central location for learning and using the tidymodels R packages","tags":["website","R","blogdown","machine learning","tidymodels"],"title":"tidymodels.org","type":"project"},{"authors":null,"categories":["workshop"],"content":"These workshops provide a gentle introduction to supervised machine learning: concepts, methods, and R code. Participants learn how to train and assess predictive models with several common machine learning algorithms, as well as how to do feature engineering to improve the predictive accuracy of their models. We focus on teaching intuitive explanations of the models and best practices for predictive modeling. Along the way, we introduce several core tidymodels packages, which provide a grammar for modeling that makes it easy to the right thing, and harder to accidentally do the wrong thing.\nSee the workshop websites for more, including links to the GitHub repositories for all workshop materials.\n","date":1580083200,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1580083200,"objectID":"680a92ce0fb594ea27cf4fc0d00ea101","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/project/tidyml/","publishdate":"2020-01-27T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/~lynham/project/tidyml/","section":"project","summary":"Introducing the basics of machine learning in R using tidymodels","tags":["workshop","R","blogdown","machine learning","tidymodels"],"title":"Introduction to Machine Learning with the Tidyverse","type":"project"},{"authors":["Rani Ekawaty","John Lynham","Peter Mous"],"categories":[],"content":"","date":1577836800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1600469187,"objectID":"7ffa5401f60cb36706a5cb2f13223ff2","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/publication/ekawaty-2020-can/","publishdate":"2024-10-15T19:55:43.879489Z","relpermalink":"/~lynham/publication/ekawaty-2020-can/","section":"publication","summary":"","tags":[],"title":"Can demand-side management replicate a size limit in a small-scale fishery?","type":"publication"},{"authors":["Anna Lou Abatayo","John Lynham","Katerina Sherstyuk"],"categories":[],"content":"","date":1577836800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1633140501,"objectID":"35718d038b29a15a071bca1f6f700c4e","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/publication/abatayo-2020-communication/","publishdate":"2024-10-15T19:55:43.574943Z","relpermalink":"/~lynham/publication/abatayo-2020-communication/","section":"publication","summary":"","tags":[],"title":"Communication, Expectations, and Trust: An Experiment with Three Media","type":"publication"},{"authors":["Juan Carlos Villaseñor-Derbez","John Lynham","Christopher Costello"],"categories":[],"content":"","date":1577836800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1600469186,"objectID":"1f94a45223c233dea473e091bf186836","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/publication/villasenor-2020-environmental/","publishdate":"2024-10-15T19:55:43.804376Z","relpermalink":"/~lynham/publication/villasenor-2020-environmental/","section":"publication","summary":"","tags":[],"title":"Environmental market design for large-scale marine conservation","type":"publication"},{"authors":["John Lynham","Anton Nikolaev","Jennifer Raynor","Thaı́s Vilela","Juan Carlos Villaseñor-Derbez"],"categories":[],"content":"","date":1577836800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1600469187,"objectID":"21c0ffdc937eabbad5ad659c85fa98fb","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/publication/lynham-2020-impact/","publishdate":"2024-10-15T19:55:43.949396Z","relpermalink":"/~lynham/publication/lynham-2020-impact/","section":"publication","summary":"","tags":[],"title":"Impact of two of the world's largest protected areas on longline fishery catch rates","type":"publication"},{"authors":["Matthew G Burgess","Ernesto Carrella","Michael Drexler","Robert L Axtell","Richard M Bailey","James R Watson","Reniel B Cabral","Michaela Clemence","Christopher Costello","Chris Dorsett"," others"],"categories":[],"content":"","date":1577836800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1600469186,"objectID":"e5c5b7a33e8aa515e60adf092d003305","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/publication/burgess-2020-opportunities/","publishdate":"2024-10-15T19:55:43.71861Z","relpermalink":"/~lynham/publication/burgess-2020-opportunities/","section":"publication","summary":"","tags":[],"title":"Opportunities for agent-based modelling in human dimensions of fisheries","type":"publication"},{"authors":["Anna Lou Abatayo","John Lynham"],"categories":[],"content":"","date":1577836800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1600469186,"objectID":"01ad44d6188649d272c83f53e2501060","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/publication/abatayo-2020-risk/","publishdate":"2024-10-15T19:55:43.646471Z","relpermalink":"/~lynham/publication/abatayo-2020-risk/","section":"publication","summary":"","tags":[],"title":"Risk preferences after a typhoon: An artefactual field experiment with fishers in the Philippines","type":"publication"},{"authors":null,"categories":["website"],"content":"RStudio’s mission is:\n“To equip everyone, regardless of means, to participate in a global economy that rewards data literacy.”\nOur education team supports this mission broadly by supporting people who want to learn R (or learn new things in R), and those who want to teach them. This website is designed for both. This website was built with Hugo, using a theme I developed and maintain. I worked with my former intern, Desirée De Leon, to create the original artwork we used for the website.\n","date":1569283200,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1569283200,"objectID":"7956a6683268e6c427dd5011aea929ce","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/project/education.rstudio.com/","publishdate":"2019-09-24T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/~lynham/project/education.rstudio.com/","section":"project","summary":"All about learning and teaching data science","tags":["website","R","blogdown","education"],"title":"education.rstudio.com","type":"project"},{"authors":null,"categories":["workshop"],"content":"Starting with a mock clinical trial dataset, we’ll use R Markdown to combine prose, R code, and figures and tables created with R code into a nicely formatted and reproducible final manuscript.\nFor the 2019 R / Medicine conference.\n","date":1568246400,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1568246400,"objectID":"ea2b240cefb50edff80e97e5f008c094","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/project/rmd4medicine/","publishdate":"2019-09-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/~lynham/project/rmd4medicine/","section":"project","summary":"A four-hour workshop that will take you on a tour of how to get from data to manuscript using R Markdown.","tags":["R","R Markdown","workshop"],"title":"R Markdown for Medicine","type":"project"},{"authors":null,"categories":null,"content":"","date":1546300800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"en","lastmod":1546300800,"objectID":"6087c0ef875554f4409ac52928d79279","permalink":"http://www2.hawaii.edu/~lynham/p